# Working documents live outside the tree — process is never committed.
# The root is a closed set: a document or stray source at the root is a
# working file unless named below; python/tools/tree_hygiene.py holds the
# same law in CI over everything git tracks.
/experimentation/
/*.pdf
/*.md
/*.txt
/*.stl
/*.obj
/*.py
/*.cpp
/*.hpp
